  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Hang It Up**: back after 36 archived shows (368 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Wait Till I Get Home**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Never Know**: back after 36 archived shows (368 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Try**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Never Wanna Let You Go**: back after 36 archived shows (368 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Too Sweet Going Down**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Give Me A Sign**: back after 36 archived shows (368 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **banter - kids songs**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2012-03-03.mk21.flac24** (recommended): audience recording; 28 songs; 235 min [1]\n- **soulive2012-03-03.mk21.flac16**: audience recording; 28 songs; 235 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Part of Bowlive 3, night 5: Nigel Hall Band opened, then Soulive played two sets, plus an afternoon Kidrocker's Bowl family show [1]\n- Bowlive 3, night 5: Nigel Hall Band opened, followed by two Soulive sets; Soulive also played an afternoon set for kids and families [2]\n- Guest credits list Marco Benevento on organ for this song, with Louis Cato on drums while Alan played guitar [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2012-03-03.mk21.flac24**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [1]. Also: This is a 24-bit version of the recording; a standard CD-quality version is offered separately and the 24-bit is not meant for MP3 or CD burning [1]\n- **soulive2012-03-03.mk21.flac16**: taped by Eric McRoberts; transferred by Eric McRoberts; source: Audience/On Stage [2]. Also: This is the 16-bit version; a higher quality 24-bit version of the same recording exists elsewhere [2]",
